Package: regextable
Title: Pattern-Based Text Extraction and Standardization Using Lookup Tables
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Shirlyn", "Dong", email = "shirlynd@umich.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Extracts structured information from text using lookup tables of
    regular expressions. Each text entry is matched against patterns in a
    specified order, and the first matching pattern is returned. Matching avoids
    re-checking patterns for entries that have already been matched, which
    improves performance when large pattern sets are used.
